# Formula files are executable Ruby that runs on users' machines during
# `brew install`, and the url/sha256 pair in each one decides which bytes get
# installed. They are the most security-sensitive files in this repository and
# every change to them requires an owner's review.
#
# The security-relevant CI — artifact integrity, provenance verification, the
# signing policy — is owned for the same reason: weakening a gate must be as
# reviewable as bypassing it.

*                                   @p4gs

/Formula/                           @p4gs
/scripts/verify-formula-artifacts.rb @p4gs
/.github/workflows/                 @p4gs
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @p4gs
/.sscsb/                            @p4gs
